  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 509.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 509.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish the requirements for selecting and contracting with a consulting engineer for projects funded in whole or in part by the CWSRF that require engineering services.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22",
